 namespace ge {
+// Arm the GPU freeze watchdog at app startup.
+//
+// Upstream only reaches ge_start_watchdog_once() from the ge_dbg_now midasm
+// hook at 0x82198C94. If the guest stalls BEFORE that hook fires -- which is
+// exactly what happens on the first macOS boot -- the watchdog never runs and
+// the stall is silent. Arming it at startup costs one sleeping thread and makes
+// the diagnostics available from the first frame onward.
+void StartGpuWatchdog() { ge_start_watchdog_once(); }
+
